    MODULES after 2M + 2G + 2T - each knows only what is listed:
    - util_funcs/uniform_buffer.c/.h (exists): nothing.
    - util_funcs/midi_buf.c/.h: uniform_buffer.
    - engine/graph.c/.h: midi_buf.
    - engine/transport.c/.h: nothing.
    - audio_backend.h, implemented by jack_funcs.c and picked at compile
